{{!< default}}

{{!--
  /dev-admin/ — Platform admin dashboard.

  Auth: any admin role grants entry. The mount React app reads the member's
  effective_capabilities from /api/profile/<uuid> (returned by the RBAC layer
  added in migration 017_admin_rbac) and gates each section accordingly.

  Sections (each visible only to capability-holders):
    Feedback   feedback.triage     queue + triage controls (placeholder until
                                    feedback_items table + submit form ship)
    Team       members.view        list admins, grant/revoke roles (functional)
    Articles   articles.*          re-polish, reclassify, archive (placeholder)
    Quotes     quotes.curate       links to /quotes/?admin=true (existing tool)
    Members    members.view        directory with PII (placeholder)
    Tuning     tuning.read         TUNING knob audit (placeholder)

  Logged-out visitors see "please sign in." Members without any admin role
  see "no access." The page itself is publicly reachable (Ghost doesn't gate
  page visibility by member status); access enforcement lives at the API
  layer via verifyCapability() in api/_capabilities.js.
--}}

<div
  id="dialecta-dev-admin-root"
  data-member-uuid="{{@member.uuid}}"
  data-member-name="{{@member.name}}"
></div>

<script src="{{asset "js/dev-admin.js"}}" defer></script>
